  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - Other/Policy Analysis and System Strengthening - Assistance for HIV/AIDS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">VIH/SIDA - Outros/An&#xE1;lise de Pol&#xED;ticas e Fortalecimento de Sistemas - Assist&#xEA;ncia para VIH/SIDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEPFAR: HIV/AIDS - Further other HIV/AIDS-related activities to support national prevention, care, and treatment efforts. This includes strengthening national and organizational policies and systems to address human resource capacity development, stigma, and discrimination, and gender issues; and other cross-cutting activities to combat HIV/AIDS including activities to support the implementation of Global Fund programs. - Assistance for HIV/AIDS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">PEPFAR: VIH/SIDA - Outras actividades relacionadas com o VIH/SIDA para apoiar os esfor&#xE7;os nacionais de preven&#xE7;&#xE3;o, cuidados e tratamento. Isto inclui o refor&#xE7;o das pol&#xED;ticas e sistemas nacionais e organizacionais para abordar o desenvolvimento da capacidade dos recursos humanos, o estigma e a discrimina&#xE7;&#xE3;o, e as quest&#xF5;es de g&#xE9;nero; e outras actividades transversais para combater o VIH/SIDA, incluindo actividades para apoiar a implementa&#xE7;&#xE3;o de programas do Fundo Global. - Assist&#xEA;ncia ao VIH/SIDA</narrative>
  </description>
